  "sourceTitle": "Pea Sprout Salad",
  "sourceText": "Pea Sprout Salad\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 11:21pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 pound Fresh pea sprouts\n3 tablespoons Rice wine vinegar\n2 tablespoons Thin soy sauce\n1 tablespoon Sugar\n1 dsh Sesame seed oil\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all and toss with pea spouts. 2 Slice rolls in half on the bias. Plate 2 rolls per plate in front of salad and drizzle with mango puree. 3 Yield: 4 portions",
